    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for amazon-ssm-agent",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for amazon-ssm-agent fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2025-47913: golang.org/x/crypto/ssh/agent: client process termination when receiving an unexpected message type\n  in response to a key listing or signing request (bsc#1253611).\n- CVE-2025-47914: golang.org/x/crypto/ssh/agent: missing validation of message sizes when processing new identity\n  requests can cause a panic due to an out-of-bounds read (bsc#1254082).\n- CVE-2025-58181: golang.org/x/crypto/ssh: missing validation of number of mechanisms specified in a request can cause\n  unbounded memory consumption (bsc#1253946).\n- CVE-2026-56854,CVE-2026-56855,CVE-2026-78662: golang.org/x/crypto/ssh: authentication bypass and deadlocks in the\n  crypto/ssh library (bsc#1278681).\n- CVE-2026-78663: golang.org/x/net/http2: double flow control refund on HTTP/2 server streams allows for flow control\n  limit bypass (bsc#1288254).\n- CVE-2026-97032: golang.org/x/net/http2: HPACK encoder race can lead to HTTP/2 server crash (bsc#1288255).\n\nChanges for amazon-ssm-agent:\n\n- Update to version 3.3.5708.0\n  * Send bucket-owner header on s3 http/https fallback\n  * Only write serial port messages when running in EC2\n  * Apply IMDS retry bound in fallback config path\n  * Harden input validation for Linux domain join parameters\n  * Add multicloud support enabling SSM Agent registration with GCP\n  * Add sqv fallthrough for setupcli when gpg is not installed\n- Update to version 3.3.5678.0\n  * Bump golang.org/x/sys from v0.47.0 to v0.48.0\n  * Bump golang.org/x/net from v0.57.0 to v0.60.0\n  * Upgrade Go version to 1.26.10\n- Raise minimum Go version to 1.26.10 in BuildRequires\n- Update to version 3.3.5538.0\n  * Bug fixes for aws-sdk-go-v2\n  * Upgrade Go version to 1.26.9\n- Raise minimum Go version to 1.26.9 in BuildRequires\n- Update to version 3.3.5390.0\n  * Bump github.com/gorilla/websocket from v1.4.2 to v1.5.3\n  * Bump golang.org/x/crypto from v0.53.0 to v0.56.0\n  * Bump golang.org/x/net from v0.56.0 to v0.57.0\n  * Bump golang.org/x/sys from v0.46.0 to v0.47.0\n  * Upgrade GoLang version from 1.25 to 1.26\n  * Mint control-channel token after dial to fix AZ-fault token expiry\n  * Resume patch documents interrupted by an external shutdown\n  * Use systemctl for systemd in aws: configureDocker on Amazon Linux\n  * Update greengrass component version to 1.3.5\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
